folder=encounters

Details[dnd-info]=The party comes across some sort of Faye creature. The Faye creature offers to make a pact with them. If the players accept, they are handed a 6-sided dice which is empty. Throughout normal play, they can choose to roll the dice. Whenever the dice lands on an empty side, the players get to choose what appears on that side of the dice. The game continues as normal until all sides of the dice are filled in. Afterwards, the pact is complete. When this happens, the Faye takes the dice back, and now gets to roll using it, reversing the process.
